  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1510.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1510.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish best management practices for blasting to minimize the potential for groundwater contamination, to ensure that the groundwater can be used for existing and future drinking water supply sources.\n\nSource. #12342, eff 8-15-17; ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36",
